        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'hangi Azalia kūnganikīla Asa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla Azalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Odedi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūja kūnsūng'wanha ū Asa; ūng'wīla, “Bebe Asa na a bing'we banhū ba Yuda na Benjamini, nidegelekagi. Ū SEEBA alī hamò ning'we ūlū mulī hamò nang'hwe; ūlū ng'ūnkooba akwilonga ū kū bing'we, alīyo ūlū ng'ūng'wība akūmuponya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli baalī bakwīja ī shikū batī hamò nang'hwe ū Mulungu wa ng'hana, yaya nūūlū kūbiza na ngabīji wa kūbalanga, nī shilagīlo būshileka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu kūzwangana kwabo, baanoga būnīlīīla ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli, būnkooba būmpandīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo gwalī mhayo gwa kwihīga ū kūyeela yeela, nguno a bikaji ba mu sī jose baalī mu kwiyugūūla kūtale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahanga giyūbūkīlaga; ihanga līmò lyalī līdūgije kūkenaagūlwa gete n'ihanga līngī, nūūlū nzengo nebe kūkenaagūlwa na nzengo gūngī. Nguno ū Mulungu wabakoyaga na mayanga ga būlī mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we bizagi na nguzu, mutizūgwa ng'holò; nguno ī shītīle shing'we shilī na mheela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asa kūbeeja mihayo būpya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Asa aho wīyiigwa ī mihayo yenīyī, ī ya būhangi ūbo akabūhaya ng'hangi Azalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Odedi, ūguzuhiwa. Ūshīnja ī shiikolile sha malofu ū mu sī ya Yuda nī Benjamini; nū kūfuma ū mu mizengo īyo walī wīdima mu sī ya magūlya ga Efulaimu. Ūgūbeeja būpya ū ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo gwalī kū būtongi w'ibīndo lya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbabilinga pye a banhū ba Yuda, nī Benjamini, na a Baefulaimu, Manase, nī Simioni abo baalī biza kwikala hamò nabo; nguno banhū bingī bakasaamīla kūlī we kūfuma ī Isilaeli, aho babona gīkī ū SEEBA Mulungu wakwe walī hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bibilinga ū mu Yelusalemu, mu ng'weji gwa kadatū gwa ng'waka gw'ikūmi n'ītanò mu būsugi bo ng'wa Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo būmfunīja shitambò ū SEEBA kwīnga ū mu shikolo īsho bakenha kūfuma kū būtindi wa būlūgū, ng'ombe magana mpungatī, na ng'holo na mbūlī shihūmbī mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bitūūla ng'wilagane lya kūnkooba SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo; kūnkooba na ng'holò jabo jose na būpanga wabo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na gīkī pye abo batūnkooba ū SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli, bakūbūlagwa, babize bado nūūlū bataale, bagosha nūūlū bakīma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlahīla kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA n'ilaka lya higūlya, kūnū bakūtūlaga mhūndū na kūfuula ndūūlilū na mhembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū ba Yuda būyega no, nguno bakilahīla na ng'holò īmò. Bakankooba ū Mulungu mu welwa ng'holò, na ng'hana wilonga ū kūbo, na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūbifuuja būlī kwene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Asa ūng'wīngīja ī likūjo nū mamaye ū Maaka, īlo lyang'winhaga lūgiili giili, īkī gīkī ngole shibyala batemi, nguno walī wabeeja ikīngī lya malofu lya ng'wa Ashela. Ūlībbutagūla ī likīngī lyenīlo ū Asa, ūūkalīponya kū longa lwa Kiduloni ūlīpemba moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū īkī atagīngije a mapandī ga higūlya ū mu Isilaeli, ū Asa walī wifunya gete ū mu ng'holò yakwe kūlī SEEBA ū mu būlamu wakwe pyī ū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī zahabu nī feza, nī shikolo ī shingī īsho ū wei nū ise baalī bashifunya sheejiwa, ūshenha mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būtilongile būlūgū hangī kūshisha ng'waka gwa makūmi adatū n'ītanò ū mu shikū ja būsugi bo ng'wa Asa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
